WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:05,820
Sister Xuanya, can we go there in the future?

2
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:10,050
But we only have wild vegetables today

3
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:11,250
Not just meat and salt

4
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:12,850
Today we make salt

5
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:15,050
As long as there is salt, wild vegetables are just as delicious

6
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:17,730
Really let her do it

7
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:20,730
If you can't do it, a hundred words of advice will be more useful than ours.

8
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:22,330
What if she really does it?

9
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:23,330
That's also a good thing

10
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:24,330
I fought with her

11
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:26,730
Who is qualified to use resources to control others?

12
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:28,330
It’s not about fighting over who must lose.

13
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,330
This is like cooperation

14
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:30,730
She really wants to make salt

15
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:32,330
I'm the first to admit that she made a contribution
